{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_title", "source_sha256": "e862f58c9168415d622bf3fc6199df6d2e17ce0585ce233ea4d8495634b16796", "ja": "天使になりたい", "zh": "想要成为天使", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_synopsis", "source_sha256": "07183e010470855355c946ce820baa27707d232bd0f1394ee085c2f5821507e5", "ja": "熱中症のスタッフを助けた事から「元看護師\r\nアイドル」と注目され、医療関係の仕事が殺\r\n到するようになる風花。かつての勤め先で自\r\n分のアイドルとしての原点に触れた事を切っ\r\n掛けに劇場のチャリティライブを提案する。", "zh": "因为救助了中暑的工作人员，风花作为“原\n护士偶像”受到瞩目，医疗相关的工作纷至\n沓来。以在曾经就职的医院重温了自己偶像\n的原点为契机，她提议举办剧场慈善演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3a5beb9e7050d6b6f0e0956ee7ef67486e4203bbf8135fc5803efaf11b2587d", "ja": "（風花に紹介してもらって、みんなで病院の講習会に\n参加した。一般向けといえど、奥が深い内容だったな）", "zh": "（托风花介绍，我们一起参加了医院的讲习会。虽然是面向普通人的课程，内容却很深奥啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "4798a80bdf721cd9b5c182c90d89eca072e8d56f7afd9a6003abe72bc78f9870", "ja": "いろいろ教えてもらったけども……難しいことも\nあったねぇ。あたしに、ちゃんとできるだろうか？", "zh": "虽然学到了很多东西……但也有些难懂的内容呢。我真的能做好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "43e00b574ff72bc392d69cd17d41c27295a38f46a189a176e63a12b1ed2d0be4", "ja": "そうだね、ひなたちゃんや星梨花ちゃんは……とにかく\n困った時は大人を呼ぶ、って覚えてくれるといいかな。", "zh": "是啊，像日向和星梨花……总之，要是能记住遇到困难时要叫大人来帮忙就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b0045b58c3cc6f16fdd39b0228ccb4335eda8fee543a54163b0cfb209e78a289", "ja": "講習でもあったけど、声をかけるとか、助けを呼ぶって\nいうのも、大事な救護活動のひとつだから。", "zh": "培训时也讲过，主动搭话或者呼叫救援，也是重要的救护活动之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "9333b80a185512cb0fe23d50a45209ce2a048689e5db9f4e06c88f4db1268073", "ja": "さっきのロールプレイング？でも、やりましたよね！\n倒れてる人を見たときの声のかけ方とか……。", "zh": "刚才的角色扮演里？也演练过了吧！\n比如看到有人倒下时该怎么搭话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "06ffa98daabde202015752956e6f343759cabe7aabd78e1912bbe428e538e07c", "ja": "わたしが演じた第一発見者の役、\n看護師さんたちに褒められて、うれしかったです。", "zh": "我扮演的第一目击者角色，\n得到了护士们的夸奖，真开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bc2e984dadb13494e6354cbfd35544e62e30508c76b20b4f8febfebb3b59f13d", "ja": "そうだな。みんな、真剣だったから……\n最後は拍手まで起こってたし。", "zh": "是啊。因为大家都很认真……\n最后甚至还响起了掌声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "10778be55e89549229ac24d4ba78e275aad096d55db3489baebea4072c9ccb2b", "ja": "あら。講習に参加した人に、\n何か配っていますわね。あれは……？", "zh": "哎呀。好像在给参加讲习的人发什么东西呢。那是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "248653580396bdaf2531968c6f64440b4ffde53c4e7118c321b4ba56770bdafc", "ja": "参加者には、救急グッズを配ってるんだよ。\nみんなも、よかったらもらって帰ってね。", "zh": "参加者会发放急救用品。\n大家如果愿意的话，也可以拿一份回去哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "16d5a7b541af4e353d0e7be987c51c422b16d1f91b71edc6a91044cee4588827", "ja": "それじゃ、もらってきましょうか！　風花ちゃんと\n{$P$}は、ここで待っててくれる？", "zh": "那么，我们去拿一些吧！风花，和{$P$}就在这里等着，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aa05f6737cf200e74216ddbff478bb72a71f936e9bea024469effe711137ae91", "ja": "すみません、このみさん。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "不好意思，木实。\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4fb9300beee7c76ca9025de55362d328ad63f6c37e3ce22873a6ca55972c20b8", "ja": "この病院に、みんなと一緒にいるなんて……\nなんだかすこし、不思議な感じがします。", "zh": "没想到能和大家一起待在这家医院里……总觉得有点不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c87c1321a7b2f6f95fbab3942ef637bd50a92474bda9da7fcfe5dc0a460085cf", "ja": "風花にとっては、元職場だもんな。改めて、今日は\nありがとう。おかげで、いい勉強になったよ。", "zh": "对风花来说，这里毕竟是她以前工作的地方。再次谢谢你，今天多亏了你，我也学到了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "42e42f5511fd1ef15213e5f89510aee5055af04d0c54a16fe802b3ba3fe4636b", "ja": "いいえ、大したことはしてませんから。それより、\nみんなが興味をもってくれたことが嬉しいですし。", "zh": "不，我也没做什么大不了的事。而且，\n大家能对这些感兴趣，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9f9dc4f9c68e7425540efc3b3f3c0f835113a381448790a78095b83a2b607304", "ja": "ちょうど私も、取材のためにちゃんと復習しようと\n思っていたところで…………あっ！", "zh": "我正好也想着为了采访好好复习一下…………啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1016_crutchesboy", "source_sha256": "337605765b932e3601cc1f8cc751726899be9e3b0fb1499d7bf3903631d6150b", "ja": "…………あ。", "zh": "…………啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a3c1c58bbbe7e56c513eb09bc9069dc4eb4f48a262f1f0dfb434924cb6975e1", "ja": "あっ、えっと……久しぶりだね！\nもしかして、サッカーでケガしちゃったのかな？", "zh": "啊，那个……好久不见！\n你该不会是在踢足球时受伤了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1018_crutchesboy", "source_sha256": "9c59f16cb7bea1c37b2d65460f54765ce40be66f6ff24f9ea414bc0b9a8d9c45", "ja": "……まあ、そんなとこ。", "zh": "……嘛，差不多就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1019_crutchesboy", "source_sha256": "8437988e1dfb58779bc6b31a0e6f6ae2d44e864c98888ecd8c6878df7ad1056b", "ja": "……じゃあ。", "zh": "……那就。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4536fd69bc5cd75cc258a0d9cb26e1038a2c8680f53d319537f3a638c289584d", "ja": "……知り合いの子か？", "zh": "……是认识的孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "487f59af0c93236fd1c14b31eca6a568c460b0755ae311e6e5e62f1a74f453b5", "ja": "あっ、すみません。あの子……昔、看護師だった頃に\n担当した患者さんの、弟さんなんです。", "zh": "啊，对不起。那孩子……是我以前当护士时负责照顾的患者的弟弟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cfa9f34c259c0c0db23b8efb70f53754605234fe4622818f68d84295efe430c5", "ja": "お兄ちゃんと一緒にサッカーをするのが好きで、\nお見舞いには、必ずボールを持って来てて……。", "zh": "他很喜欢和哥哥一起踢足球，每次来探病时，都会带着球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7936a8931ea06a7d6848c409d32784d86e9212c9c545a0a925f322708e880b0f", "ja": "病室のテレビで、3人一緒にサッカー観戦をしたことも\nあったんです。……楽しかったなぁ。", "zh": "也有过在病房的电视前，和3个人一起看足球比赛的时候。……真开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bb61ce145045a892b84724283ff8be318c6a17cfed03b4a18df65192cd14b441", "ja": "そうだったのか。風花に懐いてたんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。那时候很喜欢风花啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3f1d38acc39f1269ac54cb4aeb46f8b09d28a658c8a815547126e2a0e7bd241e", "ja": "そう、ですね。……お兄ちゃんが、\nまだサッカーを観られていた頃までは、ですけど……。", "zh": "是、这样没错。……不过，也只到哥哥还看得了足球的时候为止……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "297ada7db8697dd6fa5420cd0a386ca1e797f85937ef32db880a34dece8cb2db", "ja": "病室であの子に会う度、何度も尋ねられました。\n「お兄ちゃんは治るよね？　大丈夫だよね？」って。", "zh": "每次在病房见到那孩子，她都会一遍遍地问我：\n“哥哥会好起来的吧？没事的吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f137276516449694d4c52141f917d5d8455a7789f5d1d0deff577c2fd80fc6e", "ja": "私はただ明るく、励ますことしかできなくて。\n……なんて、無力なんだろうって思いました。", "zh": "我只能装作开朗地鼓励她……却觉得自己真是太无能为力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1030_p", "source_sha256": "09b9a7bc4974141c9d9595947dbc9e4b27a10b41cbbe417a09dbe2f81fe03af1", "ja": "そんな事はないだろ。風花は、看護師として\nちゃんと役目を果たしていたんだろうし……。", "zh": "才不是那回事吧。风花作为护士，应该也好好履行了自己的职责吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12804a9ef5a03f52c119139c6932f0219a51ce49dbaef2736771c77ec035c862", "ja": "もちろん看護師としてやれることはやったつもりです。\nでも、それだけじゃ及ばないことも多くて……。", "zh": "当然，我自认为已经尽了一名护士所能做到的一切。\n可是，仅仅这样还是有很多力所不及的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4efcf1fbb560d178e038a1192527455188af87294c488ff1ed0ea09ea7ac69eb", "ja": "やっと看護師になって、現場に立って。必死に頑張った\nつもりでも、私にできる事はこんなに少ないんだって。", "zh": "好不容易成为护士，站上了工作岗位。可即使我已经拼尽全力，却还是发现自己能做到的事情竟然这么少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1033_p", "source_sha256": "258bde34b056bf34de36d57cf28fea2aa0be792d1edd319361a9f3e6e0a23ae9", "ja": "風花……。", "zh": "风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "91dcbf74d39e8ea2943c6403a2fc73dc4de816a9fc8c5de35aca28ba921eab54", "ja": "あの子と最後に会ったとき、「なんでお兄ちゃんを\n助けてくれなかったの」って聞かれたんです。", "zh": "最后一次见到那个孩子的时候，她问我\n“为什么没有救救我哥哥呢”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "57f3ddedc0cf93ea0f1b2eb6e18df5a18b02fff85ea3a3e057ed30b8296f9fce", "ja": "私……うまく、言葉が出ませんでした。", "zh": "我……一时语塞，什么都说不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aebeb5d79c5c5e847e06f4028ea83e687057fa609c7aca4d1c430d7125e43844", "ja": "全ての人を救うなんて、大それたこと……\n一看護師のできることじゃないのは、わかってます。", "zh": "想要拯救所有人这种狂妄的念头……\n我明白，这不是一名护士力所能及的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e6bf5718589bd7c2edde168d16f5c6cc91aa384d5e337fd727d97862f2984387", "ja": "でも、私は結局お兄ちゃんを救う手伝いもできなくて。\nあの子の笑顔も、取り戻せなかった……。", "zh": "可是，我到头来连帮哥哥获救都做不到。\n就连那孩子的笑容，也没能找回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7562147f8b3275adbf45e7a33d4f49a409048a713fc45f876e14ff4bb8dec1a6", "ja": "風花……大丈夫か？", "zh": "风花……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1039_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c88994a8ad136d64fff7d6a40189979a4a431e2b52a4ed9247c2f2c5ae1706ef", "ja": "あ……す、すみません。突然、こんな話しちゃって！", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！突然说起这种事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "50f14f6e12e683206beb854c3e019c9a2183bc72c90ad81691d7ee45c8d0eddf", "ja": "この場所であの子の顔を見たら、\nあの当時の気持ちを思い出してしまって……。", "zh": "在这里看到那孩子的脸，就不由得想起了当时的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ac9c2927d4f8da4442faea263dcfdc76fb54b2366aa8916b5a2f548be63f73fb", "ja": "ちゃんと、自分の心に収めておかないとダメなのに。\nこんなふうに、吐き出して楽になろうとするなんて……", "zh": "明明应该好好把这些事藏在心里才对。\n却像这样倾诉出来，想让自己轻松一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ec86f8d518e912c1fa06c1bf801f271a7d4eadfa7098c0d992fcad8674fdc903", "ja": "私、まだまだ弱いですね。", "zh": "我，还是太软弱了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1043_p", "source_sha256": "b8da98d51fba64d5399e8da9b7a26ce4ba23d4afa7479255efdad05c290871c7", "ja": "……でも風花は、正面からその事実を受け止めようと\nしてるじゃないか。そんな人間が、弱いはずないよ。", "zh": "……但风花不是正在正面面对这个事实吗？\n这样的人，怎么可能会软弱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "62659edfef938b9803947c1e90231c6efdffed9c9dccd497b717648c9eb5b44c", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "……谢谢你。\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "62375322337c6c0f61b4af7e21a9a07c19b8c0b0e62dd95b93e4c75d405a0fe9", "ja": "あっ……もうこんな時間！\nそろそろ、ここを出ないとですよね？", "zh": "啊……已经这么晚了！\n差不多该离开这里了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1046_p", "source_sha256": "451e42fa3e6866b88b716d57e81a28e9db90dd4c2e57b7ba8a190034367c123a", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうだな。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1047_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9dfe5591594e233ec6515f536a1737750e9c548f32e01b497a60f9f39d65d796", "ja": "取材が2件と、ゲストで出る番組の打ち合わせと……。\nうん、今日も頑張らないとですね！", "zh": "采访有2个，还有作为嘉宾出演的节目的碰头会……\n嗯，今天也得加油才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1048_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a8f53aac2cdda4e7f4c9821a8407a9d19242265f1c2557b58189db870159bee8", "ja": "私、みんなのこと呼んできます。\nここで待っててください！", "zh": "我去把大家叫过来。\n请在这里等我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1049_p", "source_sha256": "2654e50c8fec3f32185c4b6a22f32dbbd7a109f8adefaca9f0f4244479da1044", "ja": "ああ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1051_null", "source_sha256": "9ae402f0bd63d4e5669b21d53d4c788695a03bf42b7cfd4c710d427175d5f399", "ja": "1週間後……", "zh": "1周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1052_p", "source_sha256": "bdf43bf66c8b4cb92c50842c7b69d7074c5ce6201a1426f2b8c83fc2f2337eb9", "ja": "（また風花に取材の依頼が来た。話題になるのは\n有り難い事だけど、ちょっと過剰な気もするな）", "zh": "（风花又收到了采访邀请。能成为话题当然是件值得感谢的事，不过，感觉好像有点过头了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1053_p", "source_sha256": "7b1f64007c6e7cca0c1791219943494630e12211db93b30c109c4342492b701a", "ja": "（新曲のレコーディングもあるし、\nあまり無理をさせないようにしないと……ん？）", "zh": "（还要录制新曲，得注意别让她太勉强自己才行……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1054_p", "source_sha256": "837276ed2f75f94a6dfdfded8a94d67be890de597fc5862b5673ab0c0e14eccb", "ja": "あそこにいるのは……。", "zh": "在那里的是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1055_039kon", "source_sha256": "d44e514642d87ab75db7d29cd69e452109f02f2f89067e2f39b2f27fc7cc4601", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといい？", "zh": "{$P$}，有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1056_p", "source_sha256": "5212468b3e1dd860a46c3382a8ea271e09332673484c186e5d384cbdb0a5414b", "ja": "あ、このみさん。それに千鶴さんも……\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，是木实小姐。还有千鹤小姐也在……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1057_038chz", "source_sha256": "c28bdb5ad1b2d14548e5d32a905acbcd2d67f3467aac1e90952dd0634b682715", "ja": "余計なお世話とも思ったのですが……\n最近の風花の忙しさが、すこし気になってしまって。", "zh": "虽然我觉得这可能是多管闲事……\n但我还是有点在意风花最近是不是太忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1058_038chz", "source_sha256": "bfa3a434f40950bbc1c0f7a14c95b98eb6aa3438226f5e8e18ad94cc2f923166", "ja": "このところ、なんだか根を詰めっぱなしのようで。\nそれも、朝早くから夜遅くまで……。", "zh": "这段时间，总觉得她一直绷得太紧了。\n而且还是从一大早忙到深夜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1059_p", "source_sha256": "bd4613c40cbe3c4e682eed7d4d9ca9512765f4a1fbbc31104437558894efbb08", "ja": "そうですね……仕事の依頼が多いのもありますけど、\n何より、風花が頑なに断らなくて。", "zh": "是啊……虽然最近工作委托确实很多，但更主要的是，风花总是固执地不肯拒绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1060_p", "source_sha256": "d31c00da30b2941ddecdde28ea4df56aebe49c4e6d49167f9b0c6a73a9d63157", "ja": "スケジュールの都合がつく限り、\n全部受けたいって譲らなくて。", "zh": "只要时间安排得过来，她就坚持要全部接下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1061_039kon", "source_sha256": "ee20fdeea19fec7cf9dede8d3e246a27920e9ab7505704da3732cb37d148721f", "ja": "そうね。私も声をかけてみたんだけど、むしろ\n普段より元気いっぱい、って感じで。", "zh": "是啊。我也试着劝过她，但她反而比平时还要精神，感觉就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "de31720cd8470b06405a3f97fb83f8104db37763a67777816a881ec7523ee2bc", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……{$P$}しか、\n風花ちゃんを止められないと思うの。", "zh": "可是，正因为这样……我觉得只有{$P$}，才能阻止风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1063_p", "source_sha256": "73f4342182d558153f1ff8969dec62b75096b7e99527dcca633093131058a0e2", "ja": "ありがとうございます、ふたりとも。\nちょうど、風花と話をしようと思っていたので……。", "zh": "谢谢你们两位。\n正好，我也正打算和风花谈谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1064_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f90bacba1658c25cb055a201cab0c63e13316d36fa8ea28fe8d779819197ea0", "ja": "あ、いた、{$P$}さん！\n……わっ、すみません。お話し中でしたか？", "zh": "啊，找到了，{$P$}先生！\n……哇，对不起，你们正在谈话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1065_038chz", "source_sha256": "0726ae9e9d23acfa50eaae313a7078ce96f77e2d2b5165ddce2171e258fa9938", "ja": "いえ、わたくしたちなら大丈夫ですわ。\nでは{$P$}、後はお願いしますね。", "zh": "不，我们这边没关系的。\n那么{$P$}，接下来就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1066_p", "source_sha256": "2507eded47c0b0e83d7ae70912ee5b4299a15ee53c6b9cc8be5fbb01b61dbbfb", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ。", "zh": "啊，交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1067_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73f68a40a719bb6725ffd407e00fc6a58e8a5803a7b90d24c233ce74a8a98cbc", "ja": "あの、お邪魔しちゃってすみません。すこし\nお話ししたいことがあるんですけど、今大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "那个，打扰到您真是不好意思。我有点\n事情想和您聊聊，请问您现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1068_p", "source_sha256": "763dd1aa787ea6a14dc8bf03d808a9f6bf17d965218f6d947e0cbfa6ae08ee4f", "ja": "大丈夫だ。\nとりあえず、場所を変えようか。", "zh": "没问题。\n先换个地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1069_p", "source_sha256": "2af339b45cfd160894ed6f689bfa5be4da1e98a4792c74cb1fb33b6459f9b89f", "ja": "それで……何かあったのか？", "zh": "所以……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1070_041fuk", "source_sha256": "53973a6ce7a4942a386ce09010f9956967f61c80e841b124736d253386595518", "ja": "はい、実は……次の定期公演について、\n私からご提案があるんです。", "zh": "是的，其实……关于下一次定期公演，\n我有个提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1071_041fuk", "source_sha256": "93e031275a660063c9eb0e6c3367903c50f3e2f012b81a4d705fbdc056e17116", "ja": "その、次の公演を……\nチャリティ形式のライブにすることはできませんか？", "zh": "那个，下一场公演能不能……办成慈善形式的演唱会呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1072_p", "source_sha256": "413f821597f5928f61fb5960f59edc82ce476fd18842abdccfb7e0b7104d714a", "ja": "チャリティ形式？", "zh": "慈善形式？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1073_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed90498b3b4edae547d29a5315a13bb1d0c0a6949c1830bf7fda12b11cd4933c", "ja": "はい。ずっとやってみたいと思ってたんです。最近、\n取材や番組に呼んでもらうことが多くなりましたし。", "zh": "是的。我一直都很想试试看。最近，  \n也越来越常被邀请去接受采访、参加节目了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1074_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed9ea9bc837b0f655701a7fdf286de1867f9ba60d254049ac6a983648a84c75c", "ja": "私の『元看護師でアイドル』っていう肩書きに注目が\n集まっている今が、絶好の機会だと思ったんです。", "zh": "现在大家正关注着我“前护士偶像”这个头衔，我觉得这正是绝佳的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1075_p", "source_sha256": "f27f3ddcaa8050b95945453aefad568d3a738155bae8322223f0ffb06194a10e", "ja": "意欲的だな。確かに、悪くない提案だと思う。", "zh": "真有干劲啊。我也觉得，这确实是个不错的提议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1076_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ac642175a3779f53dcefabcd7c37e922abfc62ea1df32ebccd40df0e86365ba9", "ja": "じゃあ……！", "zh": "那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1077_p", "source_sha256": "bff96129038898b721b8db98f33f5a4adc95b209a23b0de495b0d669738dab6b", "ja": "その前に、ひとつ。\n風花はここ最近の仕事、ひとつも断ってないよな？", "zh": "在那之前，先问一件事。\n风花最近的工作，一个都没拒绝吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1078_041fuk", "source_sha256": "db74e0909ba232f1f80001d53debbcea9b1ceb0b0349781d8bd6b4d29b874ba2", "ja": "それは……当然です。私はアイドルとして\nまだまだですし、お仕事を断るなんて……。", "zh": "那是……当然的。我作为偶像还差得远呢，怎么能拒绝工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1079_p", "source_sha256": "adb5f87e588a1ca98854d4f1d5b259d0b96626d5d3c41bcc8cbb0198bd496faa", "ja": "勿論、チャンスに乗っていく事は大事だ。\nでも今の風花は、それだけじゃないように感じる。", "zh": "当然，抓住机会很重要。\n但我觉得，现在的风花似乎还不只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1080_p", "source_sha256": "5c99e7c7319a9c42a8058a9b3542be5acf43962cc5ffdb8dc911270c3d6027a0", "ja": "……焦って、無理をしていないか？", "zh": "……你是不是太心急，在勉强自己了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1081_041fuk", "source_sha256": "621f9c50324fb21089f84ef1f978138545a1ff03018df9b31bf59b9560e3f1e8", "ja": "そんな、無理なんてしてません！　むしろ\nアイドルになれて、本当によかったって思うんです。", "zh": "才没有，我没有勉强自己！反而，我觉得自己真的很庆幸能成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1082_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0c11e2c72a6298878cd38f2a66218e148d67f91d53ea9cee69e11a9a7b4a8754", "ja": "こんな私でも、誰かの役に立てる……\nそういうものを見つけられたんだって。", "zh": "即使是这样的我，也能帮助到别人……\n我觉得自己找到了这样的意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1083_p", "source_sha256": "48011aa77bbad00a107946bf75d61b1e5c4785ce072d43c6a779dfb932b201e0", "ja": "そういえば、前にも話してくれたよな。\n風花が、アイドルを志したきっかけ。", "zh": "说起来，你之前也跟我聊过吧。\n关于风花下定决心成为偶像的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1084_p", "source_sha256": "26a38598d513aa4eee77a090edabc692c8840913d7d928c0b823abbd836c5775", "ja": "アイドルの慰問で、いつも辛そうな患者さん達が\n笑ってくれたからって。", "zh": "因为偶像慰问活动，让那些平时看起来总是很痛苦的患者们露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1085_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cb2c2ea4c859759f8d790b115cd1c6bf778f985a3e4a6c7a13bb8dffc245bea4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n覚えててくれたんですね……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n您居然还记得啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1086_p", "source_sha256": "ade0a7ca4c85e00f532e87c551e2f1ed7407d4db5e70a8024cde39f70fee61ba", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。ちゃんと覚えてるよ。", "zh": "啊，当然。我记得很清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1087_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5de9476a86c236b65a9728b3c5ac5d95ffb7ace55b325cde5cfc075294ca0bf3", "ja": "……どんなに尽くしても、力の及ばないことなんて、\n医療の現場にはいくらでもあります。", "zh": "……无论付出多少努力，也有很多超出能力所及的事情，\n在医疗现场比比皆是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1088_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3b4161c53edae7c30f715d2e5dd35f9a2a98e938ca6995c1f307b5f880a89852", "ja": "そんな時に、「これは仕方のないことだから」、\n「私は私のやれることを尽くした」って……", "zh": "那种时候，要是能说服自己“这是没办法的事”，“我已经尽我所能了”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1089_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0c8dae936996a99aa13a178372e7529982feccb8a915c2470c2122d842dba76", "ja": "そうやって、割り切れればよかったんですけど。\n私には、できなかったんです……。", "zh": "要是能那样想开就好了。\n可我做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1090_041fuk", "source_sha256": "08978216f54764a8cbf69d02f8c84a620c1ca043e7a3c5cdd83d7857f1714ce4", "ja": "せめて、寄り添いたい。\nすこしでも、笑顔になってほしい……。", "zh": "至少，我想陪在你身边。\n哪怕只有一点点，也希望你能露出笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1091_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1092_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8746d2df6c6996b82c02ea08fb9cafbd5dd06334180024ae6ed067daecee118a", "ja": "私は、患者さんや、その周りにいる……悲しむ人たちの\nためにできることが、まだあると思ったんです。", "zh": "我觉得，我还能为患者，以及身边那些悲伤的人们……做些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1093_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5630bc40fb477ed2b614048448132ddbdc1a9e288cbdddfe085d5bfc96c463aa", "ja": "悲しんでいる人に寄り添って。大丈夫だよって、\nすこしでも勇気づけてあげられたら……。", "zh": "陪伴在悲伤的人身边。要是能对他们说“没关系”，哪怕只给他们带来一点勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1094_041fuk", "source_sha256": "47c98f35afe991102fc39004d7d3bf3b9baec24c9e2f200e3f6e0a6bb5ee9bef", "ja": "それに……亡くなった人たちにだって、\n歌を捧げることができますから。", "zh": "而且……即使是已经离世的人，\n也能为他们献上歌声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1095_p", "source_sha256": "672d1c97748e6199114002173781e7f269f68786552c6dc3ed7a00e252d82047", "ja": "それが……風花がアイドルを選んだ、理由なんだな。", "zh": "原来这就是……风花选择成为偶像的理由啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1096_041fuk", "source_sha256": "76579ac30d91be072412ca75b4e87654d99a3dd371d73f872f1fce75135db509", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}さん、\nアイドルって、本当に素敵ですね。", "zh": "是的……{$P$}先生，偶像真的非常美好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1097_041fuk", "source_sha256": "53c56428f8b11412b025f4681c73c7d3df416e00092563baf170cf5ae7b52ec9", "ja": "私、こうしてアイドルになれて、幸せです。\n私にとってアイドルは、天職だと思うんです。", "zh": "我，能成为偶像，真的很幸福。对我来说，偶像就是我的天职。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1098_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3930feea7ed0fd9befb8a74c4bedde0352e0f2230012f1b363708b689fde5a7e", "ja": "だから、やれるだけやりたいんです。\n……やらせて、いただけませんか？", "zh": "所以，我想尽我所能去做。\n……可以让我去做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1099_p", "source_sha256": "d998b62f708ddcccbc8fd63b012f1f4d2059f7332aa514a563030c1fd4440837", "ja": "そうか。\n……余計な心配だったな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……是我多虑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1100_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7fbe822f90afc3411600055a22300dd8c0d7a3b03fb23374f6220def1d23b92", "ja": "そんなこと……\n心配してもらえるのは、嬉しいです。", "zh": "没那回事……\n有人为我担心，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1101_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b867dad2dcbe3dd709ad759389ec93f8ecb967f605c726a892f3d01544f80ae8", "ja": "ただ、みんな私を心配してくれるから。\nチャリティライブなんて言い始めたら、きっと……。", "zh": "只是因为大家都在担心我。要是我开始提什么慈善演唱会，大家肯定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1102_p", "source_sha256": "3c2370f09435ebf5ccab88675cc930ba13e0005623db2cedee3231b37b7685c9", "ja": "ああ、間違いなく止めるだろうな。", "zh": "啊，她们肯定会阻止我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1103_p", "source_sha256": "84663d8353bee72d4763af544f1dcf43cebaf9611df53d25f4693bf34e1a9761", "ja": "さっきも、千鶴さんとこのみさんが、\n風花を心配して俺に声をかけてきたくらいだし。", "zh": "刚才千鹤和好美还因为担心风花，特意过来找我说话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1104_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d5ddb2d058e155b2b867080215cc24c5da2cb039c4cf03c6617856b60da9a7f1", "ja": "ふふ、やっぱり。……{$P$}さん。\n私と一緒に、みんなを説得してくれませんか？", "zh": "呵呵，果然。……{$P$}先生。\n你愿意和我一起说服大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_1105", "source_sha256": "46d386f39ac9df90d3d7fd8b2b90565b29523154510538b51b6502a2be028e39", "ja": "わかった", "zh": "知道了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8407c63ed1f12ca72ad43bd51ac3ffc6f88e6b099f1b266ac53ad4a8de9921ea", "ja": "わかった、協力するよ。\nその代わり、体調管理は徹底してもらうぞ？", "zh": "我知道了，我来协助你。\n不过相对的，身体管理方面你必须彻底做好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "67a4d3bf5cc452e387f3bccf9b8380059698c26d68009058716b08b5b426202b", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん？\n誰に言ってるんですか。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生？\n您在对谁说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_130_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_130_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f2bd0f6da323349d067891fac3bcb94e8041359d474390410a648cca13b223c", "ja": "まかせてください。元看護師アイドルとして、\n体調管理は基本中の基本、ですから♪", "zh": "包在我身上吧。作为前护士偶像，\n健康管理可是基本中的基本呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
